<section id="demo" class="wrap section" aria-labelledby="demo-title" data-section="demo">
  <h2 id="demo-title">The drift problem, in one example</h2>
  <div class="col">
    <p>
      The line at the top of this page is a real recording: one participant's forearm during a wrist flexion, from a public
      dataset where the same 43 people were recorded on day 1, day 8 and day 29 with the electrodes taken off and put back
      on in between. Train a simple classifier on day 1 and test it on day 29 and it gets noticeably worse. A handful of
      fresh samples brings most of it back. I'm turning that into something you can try here.
    </p>
